# `expo prebuild` / `expo run:android` output. This project is CNG — the native
# tree is generated, never committed (a device-testing round leaves a ~170 MB
# android/ here, and an untracked build tree is one `git add -A` away from a
# PR). The narrower rules above stay for a tree someone deliberately tracks
# with `git add -f`.
/android/

